  "question": {
    "text": "An upright object is placed at a distance of <math><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> in front of a convergent lens of focal length <math><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math> A convergent mirror of focal length <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> is placed at a distance of <math><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> on the other side of the lens. The position and size of the final image will be:"
